# Pages saved exactly as a university served them.
#
# These are evidence, not source. Their whitespace is the site's own, and
# rewriting it to satisfy a whitespace check would make the fixture a slightly
# different document from the one the classifier was measured against — which
# is the one property a regression fixture has to keep.
#
# Narrow on purpose: only the saved pages, and only the whitespace check. Every
# other file in the repository is still checked, and `git diff --check` reports
# nothing outside this directory.
backend/tests/fixtures/pages/*.html -whitespace linguist-vendored
